escription      |\n| ------------------ | --------------------------- | ---------------- |\n| `image.repository` | `ghcr.io/curvineio/curvine` | Image repository |","locale":"en","table":"table-4"},"1397":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-59","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#image","content":"| Parameter   | Default | Description                      |\n| ----------- | ------- | -------------------------------- |\n| `image.tag` | `\"\"`    | Empty uses `v{Chart.AppVersion}` |","locale":"en","table":"table-4"},"1398":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-60","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#image","content":"| Parameter          | Default        | Description       |\n| ------------------ | -------------- | ----------------- |\n| `image.pullPolicy` | `IfNotPresent` | Image pull policy |","locale":"en","table":"table-4"},"1399":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-61","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#image","content":"| Parameter           | Default | Description        |\n| ------------------- | ------- | ------------------ |\n| `image.pullSecrets` | `[]`    | Image pull secrets |","locale":"en","table":"table-4"},"1400":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-62","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#openkruise","content":"`openKruise.enabled` defaults to `false`. Master and worker use standard `apps/v1` StatefulSets.","locale":"en"},"1401":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-63","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#openkruise","content":"Set `openKruise.enabled=true` to install the kruise subchart and switch master/worker to Advanced StatefulSet (`apps.kruise.io/v1beta1`).","locale":"en"},"1402":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-64","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#openkruise","content":"| Parameter            | Default | Description                 |\n| -------------------- | ------- | --------------------------- |\n| `openKruise.enabled` | `false` | Enable Advanced StatefulSet |","locale":"en","table":"table-5"},"1403":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-65","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#openkruise","content":"| Parameter                    | Default       | Description                                        |\n| ---------------------------- | ------------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `openKruise.podUpdatePolicy` | `InPlaceOnly` | `InPlaceOnly` \\| `InPlaceIfPossible` \\| `ReCreate` |","locale":"en","table":"table-5"},"1404":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-66","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#openkruise","content":"| Parameter                      