orker","content":"`worker.s3Gateway.*` is live: with `enabled: true` the chart adds the\n`[s3_gateway]` block and `worker.enable_s3_gateway` to the ConfigMap, and creates\na Service on `worker.s3Gateway.listen` (default `0.0.0.0:9900`). The worker\ncontainer still only runs `/entrypoint.sh worker start`, so nothing starts the\ngateway binary for you — run `curvine-s3-gateway` as a sidecar or a separate\nDeployment until the chart ships one.","locale":"en"},"1462":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-124","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#transfer","content":"| Parameter          | Default | Description                                                                                      |\n| ------------------ | ------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `transfer.enabled` | `false` | Creates no Transfer resources until enabled; disabled mode preserves the legacy Master Load API. |","locale":"en","table":"table-8"},"1463":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-125","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#transfer","content":"| Parameter           | Default | Description                                                                                                            |\n| ------------------- | ------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `transfer.storeUrl` | `\"\"`    | Empty infers local SQLite backed by a chart-managed PVC. Use `mysql://...` for high availability or multiple replicas. |","locale":"en","table":"table-8"},"1464":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Dep