"},"2897":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-40","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#1-report-cluster-status","content":"| Command     | Description                                                                               |\n| ----------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `cv report` | Default summary, including active master, capacity, inode/block counts, and worker lists. |","locale":"en","table":"table-1"},"2898":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-41","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#1-report-cluster-status","content":"| Command          | Description                         |\n| ---------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `cv report json` | Emit the full `MasterInfo` as JSON. |","locale":"en","table":"table-1"},"2899":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-42","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#1-report-cluster-status","content":"| Command                              | Description                                            |\n| ------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `cv report all --show-workers false` | Text summary, with optional worker detail suppression. |","locale":"en","table":"table-1"},"2900":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-43","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#1-report-cluster-status","content":"| Command                               | Description                                                      |\n| ------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `cv report capacity [WORKER_ADDRESS]` | Show cluster-wide capacity, or detai