","content":"| Command                             | Description                 |\n| ----------------------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| `cv fs rm <PATH> [-r\\|--recursive]` | Remove a file or directory. |","locale":"en","table":"table-4"},"2928":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-71","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs-file-system-operations","content":"| Command             | Description                    |\n| ------------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| `cv fs stat <PATH>` | Show file or directory status. |","locale":"en","table":"table-4"},"2929":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-72","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs-file-system-operations","content":"| Command              | Description                             |\n| -------------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| `cv fs count <PATH>` | Count files / directories under a path. |","locale":"en","table":"table-4"},"2930":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-73","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs-file-system-operations","content":"| Command                          | Description     |\n| -------------------------------- | --------------- |\n| `cv fs mv <SRC_PATH> <DST_PATH>` | Move or rename. |","locale":"en","table":"table-4"},"2931":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-74","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs-file-system-operations","content":"| Command                     | Description                 |\n| --------------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| `cv fs du <PATH> [-h] [-v]` | Show directory space usage. |","locale":"en","table":"table-4"},"2932":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-75","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs-file-system-operations","content":"| Command         | Description                             |\n| --------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| `cv fs df [-h]` | Show capacity / used / available space. |","locale":"en","table":"table-4"},"2933":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-76","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs-file-system-operations","content":"| Command                                 | Description         |\n| --------------------------------------- | ------------------- |\n| `cv fs chmod <MODE> <PATH> [RECURSIVE]` | Change permissions. |","locale":"en","table":"table-4"},"2934":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-77","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs-file-system-operations","content":"| Command                                        | Description           |\n| ---------------------------------------------- | --------------------- |\n| `cv fs chown <OWNER:GROUP> <PATH> [RECURSIVE]` | Change owner / group. |","locale":"en","table":"table-4"},"2935":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-78","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs-file-system-operations","content":"| Command                                      | Description                       |\n| -------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| `cv fs blocks <PATH> [--format table\\|json]` | Show file block location details. |","locale":"en","table":"table-4"},"2936":{"id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-79","page_id":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs-file-system-operations","content":"| Command                            