"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-38","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#配置加载流程","content":"未知配置键会由 `validation::warn_unknown_keys` 输出警告，但不会导致启动失败。拼错的键会静默保留默认值，因此请始终检查启动日志中的警告。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4486":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-39","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#配置加载流程","content":"`client.master_addrs` 可以省略。为空时，Curvine 使用 `master.rpc_port` 从 `journal.journal_addrs` 推导；如果 `journal_addrs` 也为空，则使用 `master.hostname:master.rpc_port`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4487":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-40","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#配置加载流程","content":"独立 Transfer 服务使用简化加载流程（`ClusterConf::from_transfer`），只校验 client 与 transfer 段落。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4488":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-41","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#net_interface","content":"当 `net_interface` 非空（例如 `\"eth0\"`）时，Curvine 会解析该网卡的第一个 IPv4 地址，并将其应用到 `master`、`mds`、`journal`、`worker`、`client` 和 `transfer` 的 hostname。设置该字段后，`CURVINE_*_HOSTNAME` 环境变量会被忽略。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4489":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-42","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#net_interface","content":"`net_interface` 只填充**本节点自身**的 hostname。集群成员列表（`journal.journal_addrs` 与 `client.master_addrs`）仍必须显式填写，且每个节点的条目必须使用其网卡实际解析出的 IPv4。否则节点无法在 Raft 组中定位自己，启动时会给出明确错误。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4490":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-43","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#当前配置布局","content":"当前 `ClusterConf` 的主要段落如下：","locale":"zh-cn"},"4491":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-44","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#当前配置布局","content":"| 段落   | 作用                                                                     |\n| ---- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 顶层字段 | `format_master`、`format_worker`、`testing`、`cluster_id`、`net_interface` |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"4492":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-45","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#当前配置布局","content":"| 段落         | 作用                               |\n| ---------- | -------------------------------- |\n| `[master]` | Master RPC / Web、元数据、TTL、配额、复制、锁 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"4493":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-46","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#当前配置布局","content":"| 段落      | 作用                              |\n| ------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `[mds]` | 可选的独立元数据服务（FoundationDB 或内存 KV） |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"4494":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-47","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Dep