h-cn"},"4758":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-311","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#fuse","content":"时长值支持字符串（`\"1s\"`、`\"500ms\"`、`\"1h\"`）或按毫秒解释的裸整数。旧的 `*_ms` 键仍作为别名接受。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4759":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-312","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#web","content":"`curvine-web` 是一个独立进程（二进制 `curvine-web`，通过 `bin/curvine-web.sh start` 启动），提供管理控制台：集群总览、文件浏览、Worker 列表、配置与监控大盘。它不由 `curvine-server` 启动，也不在本地集群辅助脚本的启动列表中；需要 UI 时请单独启动。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4760":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-313","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#web","content":"| 字段         | 默认值         | 含义         |\n| ---------- | ----------- | ---------- |\n| `hostname` | `localhost` | 管理控制台监听主机名 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-9"},"4761":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-314","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#web","content":"| 字段     | 默认值    | 含义            |\n| ------ | ------ | ------------- |\n| `port` | `9000` | 管理控制台 HTTP 端口 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-9"},"4762":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-315","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#web","content":"`[master].web_port`（`9010`）只是一个指标监听端口，用浏览器打开它只会得到 Prometheus 文本输出，不是管理界面。UI 请访问 `[web].port`（`9000`）。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4763":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-316","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"管理控制台内嵌了自己的采集器和时序库，因此不依赖 Prometheus 也能看大盘。把 `mode` 改成 `prometheus` 或 `auto` 可改为查询已有的 Prometheus。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4764":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-317","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"| 字段        | 默认值    | 含义         |\n| --------- | ------ | ---------- |\n| `enabled` | `true` | 是否启用可观测性组件 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-10"},"4765":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-318","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"| 字段     | 默认值       | 含义                              |\n| ------ | --------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `mode` | `builtin` | `builtin`、`prometheus` 或 `auto` |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-10"},"4766":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-319","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"| 字段                | 默认值   | 含义         |\n| ----------------- | ----- | ---------- |\n| `scrape_interval` | `60s` | 内置采集器的抓取间隔 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-10"},"4767":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-320","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"| 字段               | 默认值  | 含义      |\n| ---------------- | ---- | ------- |\n| `scrape_timeout` | `3s` | 单目标抓取超时 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-10"},"4768":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-321","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"| 字段          | 默认值   | 含义        |\n| ----------- | ----- | --------- |\n| `retention` | `24h` | 内存时序库保留窗口 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-10"},"4769":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-322","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"| 字段                       | 默认值  | 含义     |\n| ------------------------ | ---- | ------ |\n| `max_concurrent_scrapes` | `32` | 并发抓取上限 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-10"},"4770":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-323","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"| 字段                                 | 默认值 | 含义              |\n| ---------------------------------- | --- | --------------- |\n| `max_concurrent_dashboard_queries` | `8` | 单次大盘刷新的并发范围查询上限 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-10"},"4771":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-324","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"| 字段           | 默认值      | 含义     |\n| ------------ | -------- | ------ |\n| `max_series` | `100000` | 序列基数上限 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-10"},"4772":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-325","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"| 字段                       | 默认值     | 含义         |\n| ------------------------ | ------- | ---------- |\n| `max_samples_per_series` | `10000` | 每个序列保留的样本数 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-10"},"4773":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-326","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservabilityfuse","content":"FUSE 指标抓取默认关闭。`enabled = true` 且 `targets` 为空时，采集器会抓取 `127.0.0.1:{fuse.web_port}`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4774":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-327","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservabilityfuse","content":"| 字段        | 默认值     | 含义                         |\n| --------- | ------- | -------------------------- |\n| `enabled` | `false` | 是否发现并抓取 FUSE `/metrics` 端点 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-11"},"4775":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-328","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservabilityfuse","content":"| 字段        | 默认值  | 含义                                             |\n| --------- | ---- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| `targets` | `[]` | `host:port` 或完整的 `http://host:port/metrics` 地址 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-11"},"4776":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-329","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservabilityprometheus","content":"| 字段    | 默认值 | 含义                                          |\n| ----- | --- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| `url` | 空   | Prometheus 基础地址，例如 `http://prometheus:9090` |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-12"},"4777":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-330","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservabilityprometheus","content":"| 字段              | 默认值  | 含义                   |\n| --------------- | ---- | -------------------- |\n| `query_timeout` | `5s` | Prometheus 查询 API 超时 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-12"},"4778":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-331","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservabilityprometheus","content":"| 字段                 | 默认值    | 含义                                        |\n| ------------------ | ------ | ----------------------------------------- |\n| `fallback_builtin` | `true` | `mode = \"auto\"` 时，Prometheus 不可用则回退到内置采集器 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-12"},"4779":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-332","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservabilityprometheus","content":"| 字段                 | 默认值   | 含义                        |\n| ------------------ | ----- | ------------------------- |\n| `target_cache_ttl` | `30s` | `/api/v1/targets` 响应的缓存时长 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-12"},"4780":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-333","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservabilityprometheus","content":"当 `mode = \"prometheus\"` 时，还需要按 `etc/prometheus-curvine.yml` 中的说明加上目标标签，大盘才能把指标归属到正确的角色。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4781":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-334","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#s3_gateway","content":"S3 兼容网关是一个独立服务（二进制 `curvine-s3-gateway`，通过 `bin/curvine-s3-gateway.sh start` 启动）。本段只被网关进程读取，Master 和 Worker 会忽略它。支持的 API 范围见 S3 对象存储网关。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4782":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-335","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#s3_gateway","content":"| 字段       | 默认值            | 含义           |\n| -------- | -------------- | ------------ |\n| `listen` | `0.0.0.0:9900` | S3 HTTP 监听地址 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-13"},"4783":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-336","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#s3_gateway","content":"| 字段       | 默认值         | 含义                                       |\n| -------- | ----------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| `region` | `us-east-1` | `GetBucketLocation` 返回的区域，也用于 SigV4 签名范围 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-13"},"4784":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-337","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#s3_gateway","content":"| 字段             | 默认值                 | 含义                  |\n| -------------- | ------------------- | ------------------- |\n| `put_temp_dir` | `/tmp/curvine-temp` | PUT 暂存目录（分片和普通上传共用） |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-13"},"4785":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-338","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#s3_gateway","content":"| 字段                            | 默认值       | 含义                                  |\n| ----------------------------- | --------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `put_memory_buffer_threshold` | `1048576` | 低于该大小的 PUT 在内存中缓冲，不落 `put_temp_dir` |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-13"},"4786":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-339","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#s3_gateway","content":"| 字段                      | 默认值        | 含义     |\n| ----------------------- | ---------- | ------ |\n| `put_max_memory_buffer` | `16777216` | 内存缓冲上限 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-13"},"4787":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-340","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#s3_gateway","content":"| 字段                          | 默认值 | 含义               |\n| --------------------------- | --- | ---------------- |\n| `access_key` / `secret_key` | 空   | 不使用分布式凭证存储时的静态密钥 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-13"},"4788":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-341","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#s3_gateway","content":"| 字段                        | 默认值     | 含义                       |\n| ------------------------- | ------- | ------------------------ |\n| `enable_distributed_auth` | `false` | 从 Curvine 加载凭证，而不是使用静态密钥 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-13"},"4789":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-342","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#s3_gateway","content":"| 字段                 | 默认值 | 含义                 |\n| ------------------ | --- | ------------------ |\n| `credentials_path` | 空   | 存放凭证文件的 Curvine 路径 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-13"},"4790":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-343","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#s3_gateway","content":"| 字段                            | 默认值  | 含义       |\n| ----------------------------- | ---- | -------- |\n| `cache_refresh_interval_secs` | `30` | 凭证缓存刷新间隔 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-13"},"4791":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-344","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#s3_gateway","content":"| 字段                  | 默认值   | 含义                        |\n| ------------------- | ----- | ------------------------- |\n| `get_chunk_size_mb` | `1.0` | 读块大小（MB），可选 `0.5`、`1`、`2` |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-13"},"4792":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-345","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#s3_gateway","content":"| 字段         | 默认值    | 含义                  |\n| ---------- | ------ | ------------------- |\n| `web_port` | `9003` | 网关健康检查 / 指标 HTTP 端口 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-13"},"4793":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-346","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#s3_gateway","content":"`worker.enable_s3_gateway`（默认 `false`）决定分片上传的暂存位置：`false` 时存放在网关宿主机的本地文件系统，`true` 时使用 Curvine DFS，从而允许多个网关实例共同处理同一次上传。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4794":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-347","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#s3_gateway","content":"`worker.enable_s3_gateway` 由网关进程读取，Worker 本身不读取该字段。可以只在网关的配置文件里设置，无需重启 Worker。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4795":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-348","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#全局-log","content":"顶层 `[log]` 由 Rust 客户端与 FUSE 共用。每个服务还有自己的嵌套 `log` 表（`master.log`、`worker.log`、`mds.log`、`transfer.log`），CLI 使用 `[cli].log`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4796":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-349","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#全局-log","content":"| 字段      | 默认值    | 含义   |\n| ------- | ------ | ---- |\n| `level` | `INFO` | 日志级别 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-14"},"4797":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-350","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#全局-log","content":"| 字段        | 默认值      | 含义                           |\n| --------- | -------- | ---------------------------- |\n| `log_dir` | `stdout` | `stdout`、`stderr` 或用于文件日志的目录 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-14"},"4798":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-351","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#全局-log","content":"| 字段          | 默认值 | 含义                      |\n| ----------- | --- | ----------------------- |\n| `file_name` | 空   | 日志文件基础名；为空时使用 `curvine` |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-14"},"4799":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-352","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#全局-log","content":"| 字段              | 默认值  | 含义       |\n| --------------- | ---- | -------- |\n| `max_log_files` | `10` | 保留的轮转文件数 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-14"},"4800":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-353","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#全局-log","content":"| 字段                 | 默认值   | 含义                       |\n| ------------------ | ----- | ------------------------ |\n| `max_file_size_mb` | `100` | 按大小轮转的阈值（MB）；`0` 表示不限制大小 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-14"},"4801":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-354","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deplo