ploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#worker","content":"`worker.s3Gateway.*` 是生效的：`enabled: true` 时 Chart 会把 `[s3_gateway]` 和 `worker.enable_s3_gateway` 写进 ConfigMap，并在 `worker.s3Gateway.listen`（默认 `0.0.0.0:9900`）上创建 Service。但 worker 容器仍然只运行 `/entrypoint.sh worker start`，不会帮你启动网关进程——在 Chart 提供之前，请用 sidecar 或单独的 Deployment 运行 `curvine-s3-gateway`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4999":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-134","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#service","content":"| 参数                    | 默认值         | 说明                          |\n| --------------------- | ----------- | --------------------------- |\n| `service.master.type` | `ClusterIP` | Headless（`ClusterIP: None`） |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-9"},"5000":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-135","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#service","content":"| 参数                    | 默认值         | 说明                          |\n| --------------------- | ----------- | --------------------------- |\n| `service.worker.type` | `ClusterIP` | Headless（`ClusterIP: None`） |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-9"},"5001":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-136","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#service","content":"| 参数                               | 默认值     | 说明          |\n| -------------------------------- | ------- | ----------- |\n| `service.masterExternal.enabled` | `false` | 外部访问 master |","locale":"zh-cn","ta