re","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deployment-Overview/Deployment-Architecture#组件作用","content":"**客户端库**：提供多语言API，通过RPC与Master节和Worker节点通信","locale":"zh-cn"},"5281":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deployment-Overview/Deployment-Architecture-21","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deployment-Overview/Deployment-Architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deployment-Overview/Deployment-Architecture#curvine-mastercurvine-worker-与-curvine-fuse-的关系","content":"Master 以**多节点**（Raft 组）形式部署；客户端与 FUSE 与当前 Master Leader 通信。下图表示逻辑角色关系。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5282":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deployment-Overview/Deployment-Architecture-22","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deployment-Overview/Deployment-Architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deployment-Overview/Deployment-Architecture#curvine-fuse-使用场景","content":"当需要让现有应用程序无需修改即可访问 Curvine 分布式缓存时，使用 FUSE 可以将 Curvine 挂载为本地文件系统。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5283":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deployment-Overview/Deployment-Architecture-23","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deployment-Overview/Deployment-Architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deployment-Overview/Deployment-Architecture#curvine-fuse-使用场景","content":"默认挂载点","locale":"zh-cn"},"5284":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deployment-Overview/Deployment-Architecture-24","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deployment-Overview/Deployment-Architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deployment-Overview/Deployment-Architecture#curvine-fuse-使用场景","content":"/curvine-fuse","locale":"zh-cn"},"5285":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deployment-Overview","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deployment-Overview","type":"page","content":"部署总览","breadcrumbs":["Documents","部署","Deployment Overview"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deployment-Overview","locale":"zh-cn"},"5286":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deployment-Overview-0","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deployment-Overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deployment-Over