User-Manuals/Access/fuse-9","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse","content":"在云原生场景下，可通过卷挂载使用 FUSE；Curvine 还提供 CSI 驱动 用于 Kubernetes。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5678":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse-10","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse","content":"**FUSE 是可选接入方式。** 须先启动 Curvine 集群（Master + Worker），FUSE 仅在应用需要 POSIX 挂载点时使用。各组件角色见 部署架构。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5679":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse-11","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse#前置条件","content":"**Curvine 集群**已启动（已启动 Master 与 Worker）。参见 裸机部署 或 快速开始。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5680":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse-12","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse#前置条件","content":"**配置**：运行 FUSE 的节点需能访问集群配置文件（如 `conf/curvine-cluster.toml`），且 Master 地址正确。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5681":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse-13","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse#前置条件","content":"**系统支持**：支持 FUSE2 与 FUSE3，不同发行版行为可能略有差异。详见 支持的 Linux 发行版。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5682":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse-14","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse#启动-fuse","content":"在安装目录下执行（如 `build/dist` 或解压后的发布包）：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5683":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse-15","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse#启动-fuse","content":"**默认挂载路径**：`/curvine-fuse`","locale":"zh-cn"},"5684":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse-16","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse#启动-fuse"