Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-36","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#bucket-不存在","content":"Bucket 不存在","locale":"zh-cn"},"5752":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-37","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#连通性检查","content":"连通性检查","locale":"zh-cn"},"5753":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-38","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#性能调优","content":"性能调优","locale":"zh-cn"},"5754":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-39","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","content":"Curvine S3 网关通过 S3 兼容的 HTTP API 暴露 Curvine 集群。已经支持 S3 协议的工具——AWS CLI、MinIO Client、boto3 或任意 S3 SDK——无需 FUSE 或 Curvine 原生客户端即可读写 Curvine 路径。网关使用 AWS Signature V2/V4 对每个请求进行认证，并将 bucket 和 key 映射为 Curvine 文件系统操作。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5755":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-40","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","content":"网关是一个可选的独立服务，不由 `curvine-server` 启动，但**已经包含在默认构建和发行包中**：`build.sh` 的默认 `--package all` 会构建 `curvine-s3-gateway`，发行包中也会带上 `bin/curvine-s3-gateway.sh`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5756":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-41","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#概述","content":"S3 请求进入网关后，先通过凭据存储完成认证，再经由 Curvine 客户端执行。对象数据以流式方式在网关与 Curvine Worker 之间传输，不会将整个对象缓存在内存中。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5757":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-42","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#主要特性","content":"S3 兼容的 bucket 和对象 API（见 支持的 S3 操作）","locale":"zh-cn"},"5758":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-43","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#主要特性","content":"使用 AWS Signature V2/V4 认证，支持本地或 Curvine 托管的凭据存储","locale":"zh-cn"},"5759":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-44","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#主要特性","content":"支持 HTTP Range 请求，返回 `206 Partial Content`","locale":"zh-cn"},"5760":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-45","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#主要特性","content":"支持大对象分片上传","locale":"zh-cn"},"5761":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-46","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#主要特性","content":"流式读写","locale":"zh-cn"},"5762":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-47","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#主要特性","content":"支持独立部署，并可通过负载均衡横向扩展","locale":"zh-cn"},"5763":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-48","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#架构说明","content":"S3 网关是 S3 API 客户端的前端，负责将 S3 请求转换为 Curvine 文件系统操作：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5764":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-49","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#bucket-操作","content":"| 操作             | HTTP 请求         |\n| -------------- | --------------- |\n| `CreateBucket` | `PUT /{bucket}` |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"5765":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access