| 描述                      |\n| ----------------------------- | ------- | --------- | ----------------------- |\n| `put_memory_buffer_threshold` | integer | `1048576` | PUT 时小于该大小（字节）的对象缓存在内存中 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-5"},"5805":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-90","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#s3_gateway-配置","content":"| 参数                      | 类型      | 默认值        | 描述                  |\n| ----------------------- | ------- | ---------- | ------------------- |\n| `put_max_memory_buffer` | integer | `16777216` | PUT 时内存缓冲区的最大大小（字节） |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-5"},"5806":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-91","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#s3_gateway-配置","content":"| 参数                  | 类型    | 默认值   | 描述               |\n| ------------------- | ----- | ----- | ---------------- |\n| `get_chunk_size_mb` | float | `1.0` | GET 响应的读写块大小（MB） |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-5"},"5807":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-92","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#s3_gateway-配置","content":"| 参数                        | 类型      | 默认值     | 描述                         |\n| ------------------------- | ------- | ------- | -------------------------- |\n| `enable_distributed_auth` | boolean | `false` | 将凭据存储在 Curvine 中，而不是本地文件系统 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-5"},"5808":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-93","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#s3_gateway-配置","content":"| 参数                 | 类型     | 默认值 | 描述     |\n| ------------------ | ------ | --- | ------ |\n| `credentials_path` | string | 见下文 | 凭据存储路径 |","locale":"z