nuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#多实例","content":"如果未启用分布式存储，分片会保留在接收该分片的实例本地 `put_temp_dir` 中；路由到其他实例的 `CompleteMultipartUpload` 将找不到这些分片。另一种方式是在负载均衡上配置会话保持。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5828":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-113","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#监控与日志","content":"网关通过 `tracing` 将日志输出到 stdout。可以使用 `RUST_LOG` 调整日志级别：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5829":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-114","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#监控与日志","content":"日志覆盖请求处理、认证失败、分片操作和文件系统错误。目前没有 metrics 端点；请使用 `/healthz` 端点进行存活检查。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5830":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-115","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#限制","content":"未实现 `CopyObject`；客户端需要先下载再重新上传。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5831":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-116","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#限制","content":"未实现 `AbortMultipartUpload`；放弃的上传会遗留临时分片。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5832":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-117","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#限制","content":"`ListObjectsV2` 只返回单页：`continuation-token` 和 `max-keys` 会被忽略，`is-truncated` 始终为 `false`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5833":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-118","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#限制","content":"接受条件请求头（`If-Match`、`If-None-Match`），但不会对其进行判断。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5834":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-119","page_id":