/StatefulSet-24","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet#说明","content":"示例中的 `volumeClaimTemplates` 使用 `ReadWriteOnce`，这符合 StatefulSet 常见的一副本一写者模式。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6133":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet-25","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet#说明","content":"动态创建的 Curvine 目录仍然是由 StorageClass 的 `fs-path` 加 PV 名称组合出来的，而不是直接用 Pod 序号命名。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6134":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet-26","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/StatefulSet#说明","content":"FUSE 复用仍然发生在节点层面，键是 `master-addrs + fs-path`；Pod 间数据隔离来自各自 PVC 指向的不同子目录。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6135":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver","type":"page","content":"K8S CSI Driver","breadcrumbs":["Documents","用户手册","K8S CSI 驱动"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver","locale":"zh-cn"},"6136":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","type":"page","content":"缓存","breadcrumbs":["Documents","用户手册","核心特征"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","locale":"zh-cn"},"6137":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-0","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#一什么是-curvine","content":"一、什么是 Curvine？","locale":"zh-cn"},"6138":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-1","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#二核心特性","content":"二、核心特性","locale":"zh-cn"},"6139":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-F