8","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#75-master-节点ttl-检查器","content":"7.5 Master 节点（TTL 检查器）","locale":"zh-cn"},"6156":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-19","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#76-执行流程","content":"7.6 执行流程","locale":"zh-cn"},"6157":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-20","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#八数据淘汰机制配额与-lru","content":"八、数据淘汰机制（配额与 LRU）","locale":"zh-cn"},"6158":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-21","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#81-工作原理","content":"8.1 工作原理","locale":"zh-cn"},"6159":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-22","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#82-配置示例","content":"8.2 配置示例","locale":"zh-cn"},"6160":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-23","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#83-与-ttl-的关联","content":"8.3 与 TTL 的关联","locale":"zh-cn"},"6161":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-24","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#九缓存方式","content":"九、缓存方式","locale":"zh-cn"},"6162":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-25","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#91-自动缓存","content":"9.1 自动缓存","locale":"zh-cn"},"6163":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-26","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#92-主动缓存","content":"9.2 主动缓存","locale":"zh-cn"},"6164":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-27","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#十快速小结","content":"十、快速小结","locale":"zh-cn"},"6165":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-28","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","content":"对于初次接触的使用者来说，你可以把 Curvine 简单理解为：一个可以像本地磁盘一样使用的分布式文件缓存。它不用你关心数据存在集群的哪台机器、哪种存储上，只需通过一个挂载点，就能轻松使用分布式的缓存能力，适配绝大多数日常文件操作场景。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6166":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-29","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#一什么是-curvine","content":"Curvine 是一款分布式文件缓存系统，它能够把集群内的各类存储介质、远端存储资源整合在一起，构建出一个统一的文件目录空间，并且对外提供可直接挂载的文件系统。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6167":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-30","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#一什么是-curvine","content":"和传统分布式文件系统不同，Curvine 最大的亮点是完整兼容 POSIX 语义，使用体验和你电脑上的本地磁盘几乎没有区别。不用额外学习复杂的操作指令，也不用改造原有应用，不管是日常开发、数据缓存、`git clone`、数据库文件存储、日志写入还是临时文件存放，直接把文件路径指向 Curvine 挂载点即可，完全做到“即挂即用”。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6168":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-31","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#二核心特性","content":"| 核心能力   | 通俗说明                                                                          |\n| ------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 统一命名空间 | 只用一个挂载点，就能访问全部文件目录，不用关心数据具体存在哪台 Worker 节点、哪种存储介质上；文件路径、权限设置和本地文件系统完全一致，上手零成本。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"6169":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-32","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#二核心特性","content":"| 核心能力         | 通俗说明                                                                   |\n| ------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 高速缓存，重复访问更流畅 | 常用的工作数据会驻留在集群内速度更快的介质中，反复访问这些数据时，能大幅减少对远端存储或低速存储的 I/O 请求，打开、读取文件的速度更快。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"6170":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-33","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#二核心特性","content":"| 核心能力   | 通俗说明                                                                                                   |\n| ------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 智能分层存储 | 支持内存（MEM）、固态硬盘（SSD）、机械硬盘（HDD）多种存储层级，管理员提前配置好各层级路径，使用者可以指定优先写入的介质；当优先层级空间不足时，数据会自动向下一层级溢出，平衡速度、成本和存储容量。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"6171":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-34","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#二核心特性","content":"| 核心能力   | 通俗说明                                                           |\n| ------ | -------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 智能空间管理 | 通过 TTL 时间过期和配额 + LRU 淘汰双重机制管控存储空间，避免缓存无限占用集群容量，不用手动清理也能保持空间充足。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"6172":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-35","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#二核心特性","content":"| 核心能力          | 通俗说明                                                                             |\n| ------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 完整 POSIX 文件语义 | 全面支持各类标准文件操作，包括随机写、并发写、文件锁、扩展属性、软硬链接、稀疏文件等，能适配日志、数据库、项目构建等真实业务场景，原有本地应用直接迁移即可使用。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"6173":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-36","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#三和本地磁盘一样的使用体验","content":"Curvine 完全贴合本地磁盘使用习惯。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6174":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-37","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#31-多进程并发写入","content":"多个客户端、多个进程可以同时写入同一个文件，不需要应用自己做协调管控，只要写入文件的不同偏移位置，就不会出现数据混乱，和本地多进程写文件的语义完全一致。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6175":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-38","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#32-自由随机写入","content":"不限制只能顺序写或追加写，支持在文件的任意位置随时写入数据，适配数据库、大文件修改等需要随机读写的场景。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6176":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-39","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#33-常用命令全兼容","content":"Linux 系统下所有常规文件操作命令，比如 `cp`（复制）、`mv`（移动）、`rm`（删除）、`mkdir`（新建文件夹）、`ls`（查看目录）、`find`（查找文件）等，在 Curvine 挂载点上都能正常使用，操作习惯完全不用改。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6177":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-40","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#四posix-高级特性详解","content":"Curvine 完整支持各类 POSIX 高级特性，满足各类复杂业务需求，具体能力说明如下：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6178":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-41","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#四posix-高级特性详解","content":"| 特性名称      | 详细说明                                                 |\n| --------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| 随机写 & 并发写 | 支持文件任意位置写入，多客户端可同时操作同一文件的不同区域，适配日志、数据库等对写入灵活性要求高的场景。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"6179":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-42","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#四posix-高级特性详解","content":"| 特性名称          | 详细说明                                           |\n| ------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| 扩展属性（`xattr`） | 完整支持文件扩展属性，使用者可以自定义存储文件的专属元数据，方便做文件标记、业务关联等操作。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"6180":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-43","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#四posix-高级特性详解","content":"| 特性名称      | 详细说明                                                                    |\n| --------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 符号链接（软链接） | 支持软链接功能，建议链接目标都指向 Curvine 内部路径；如果链接到本机其他目录或其他节点本地路径，分布式环境下其他节点可能无法正常访问。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"6181":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-44","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#四posix-高级特性详解","content":"| 特性名称 | 详细说明                                                |\n| ---- | --------------------------------------------------- |\n| 硬链接  | 支持硬链接，语义和本地文件系统一致，仅适用于 Curvine 内部同一文件系统范围内，跨系统无法创建。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"6182":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-45","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#四posix-高级特性详解","content":"| 特性名称 | 详细说明                                                                          |\n| ---- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 文件锁  | 兼容 POSIX 锁和 BSD 锁，考虑到分布式环境的稳定性，文件锁带有默认 5 分钟超时自动释放机制，避免客户端或节点异常导致锁一直占用，引发死锁问题。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"6183":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-46","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#四posix-高级特性详解","content":"| 特性名称       | 详细说明                                       |\n| ---------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| 稀疏文件（文件空洞） | 支持稀疏文件模式，没有实际写入数据的空洞区域不会占用物理存储空间，节省集群存储资源。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"6184":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-47","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#四posix-高级特性详解","content":"| 特性名称  | 详细说明                                        |\n| ----- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| 空间预分配 | 支持提前为文件分配存储空间，避免大文件写入过程中出现空间不足的问题，保证写入流程稳定。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"6185":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-48","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#四posix-高级特性详解","content":"| 特性名称   | 详细说明                                                       |\n| ------ | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 常规文件属性 | 文件权限位、访问/修改时间戳、文件截断等基础 inode 语义，完全遵循 POSIX 标准，和本地文件操作体验一致。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"6186":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-49","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#五分层存储使用说明","content":"Curvine 支持多层级存储介质，通过简单配置即可指定数据存储优先级，兼顾速度与成本。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6187":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-50","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#51-工作原理","content":"Worker 节点配置各存储层级的路径和标签，使用者在客户端指定优先使用的存储类型，数据会优先写入目标层级；当该层级容量不足时，会自动降级到下一层级存储，无需手动干预。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6188":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-51","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#52-配置示例","content":"Worker 节点配置：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6189":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-52","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#52-配置示例","content":"客户端配置：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6190":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-53","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#52-配置示例","content":"配置效果：新建文件优先存入内存层，内存空间不足时，自动依次存入 SSD、HDD 层。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6191":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-54","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#61-写入策略","content":"写入策略控制挂载路径上的数据写入方式，通过 `cv mount ... --write-type <类型>` 配置，CLI 默认值为 `fs_mode`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6192":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-55","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#61-写入策略","content":"| 策略        | CLI 取值       | 行为                                 | 适用场景            |\n| --------- | ------------ | ---------------------------------- | --------------- |\n| CacheMode | `cache_mode` | 直接写到底层 UFS，Curvine 主要承担统一访问与缓存读取层。 | 数据主存仍在 UFS 的场景。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-2"},"6193":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-56","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#61-写入策略","content":"| 策略     | CLI 取值    | 行为                                       | 适用场景                   |\n| ------ | --------- | ---------------------------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| FsMode | `fs_mode` | 优先写入 Curvine 命名空间；首次挂载时可能触发元数据 `resync`。 | 由 Curvine 管理缓存命名空间的场景。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-2"},"6194":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-57","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#62-读取校验","content":"当前面向用户的读侧校验开关是挂载参数 `--read-verify-ufs`：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6195":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-58","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#62-读取校验","content":"| 策略  | 行为                 |\n| --- | ------------------ |\n| 关闭  | 信任缓存与统一文件系统默认回退逻辑。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-3"},"6196":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-59","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#62-读取校验","content":"| 策略  | 行为                              |\n| --- | ------------------------------- |\n| 开启  | 读前按 UFS 元数据（`mtime` 与文件长度）校验缓存。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-3"},"6197":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-60","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#62-读取校验","content":"当校验失败或缓存未命中时，会直接从 UFS 读取；若该挂载启用了自动缓存，可同时异步将数据加载到 Curvine。`[transfer] enabled = true` 时，该任务由独立 Transfer 服务负责；否则仍使用旧 Master 任务路径。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6198":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-61","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#七数据过期管理ttl","content":"为了合理管控缓存空间，Curvine 支持为文件、目录配置过期时间和过期策略，自主控制数据生命周期。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6199":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-62","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#71-基础配置示例","content":"配置效果：文件从最后一次修改时间（`mtime`）开始计算，1 天后自动过期，执行删除操作。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6200":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-63","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#72-按挂载配置-ttl","content":"使用 `cv mount` 挂载 UFS 时，可为该挂载设置 TTL：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6201":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-64","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#72-按挂载配置-ttl","content":"| 选项         | 类型       | 默认值        | 说明       | 示例               |\n| ---------- | -------- | ---------- | -------- | ---------------- |\n| `--ttl-ms` | duration | `7d`（挂载默认） | 缓存数据过期时间 | `24h`、`7d`、`30d` |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"6202":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-65","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#72-按挂载配置-ttl","content":"挂载点的 TTL 动作由 `write_type` 推导：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6203":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-66","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#72-按挂载配置-ttl","content":"`cache_mode` 挂载默认对应 `delete`","locale":"zh-cn"},"6204":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-67","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#72-按挂载配置-ttl","content":"`fs_mode` 挂载默认对应 `free`","locale":"zh-cn"},"6205":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-68","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#73-过期策略说明","content":"| 策略取值   | 具体含义                            |\n| ------ | ------------------------------- |\n| `none` | 关闭时间过期功能，数据会一直保留，直到手动删除或其他策略清理。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-5"},"6206":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-69","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#73-过期策略说明","content":"| 策略取值     | 具体含义                                         |\n| -------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `delete` | 过期后彻底删除文件数据和元数据，是最常用的“到期清理”策略，时间从文件最后修改时间算起。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-5"},"6207":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-70","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#73-过期策略说明","content":"| 策略取值   | 具体含义                                          |\n| ------ | --------------------------------------------- |\n| `free` | 过期后只释放文件占用的数据块，保留目录和元数据，适合需要保留目录结构、清理缓存数据的场景。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-5"},"6208":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-71","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#74-使用注意mtime-与数据拷贝","content":"使用 `rclone` 等工具往 Curvine 拷贝文件时，工具会保留源文件的原始修改时间（`mtime`）。如果源文件本身已经存放很久，拷贝后可能会立刻触发 TTL 过期，导致文件被删除或释放。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6209":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-72","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#74-使用注意mtime-与数据拷贝","content":"建议大批量导入数据前，先确认 TTL 配置，或导入后手动调整文件 `mtime`、临时关闭 TTL，避免数据误清理。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6210":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-73","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#75-master-节点ttl-检查器","content":"在集群配置的 `[master]` 段中，使用以下 TOML 键：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6211":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-74","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#75-master-节点ttl-检查器","content":"| 参数                     | 类型       | 默认值  | 说明          |\n| ---------------------- | -------- | ---- | ----------- |\n| `ttl_checker_interval` | duration | `1h` | TTL 检查器运行间隔 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-6"},"6212":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-75","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#75-master-节点ttl-检查器","content":"| 参数                           | 类型  | 默认值 | 说明               |\n| ---------------------------- | --- | --- | ---------------- |\n| `ttl_checker_retry_attempts` | u32 | `3` | TTL 操作失败时的最大重试次数 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-6"},"6213":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-76","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#75-master-节点ttl-检查器","content":"| 参数                    | 类型       | 默认值  | 说明                  |\n| --------------------- | -------- | ---- | ------------------- |\n| `ttl_bucket_interval` | duration | `1h` | 批量处理过期 inode 的桶时间间隔 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-6"},"6214":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-77","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#75-master-节点ttl-检查器","content":"| 参数                       | 类型       | 默认值   | 说明               |\n| ------------------------ | -------- | ----- | ---------------- |\n| `ttl_max_retry_duration` | duration | `10m` | 失败 TTL 操作的最大重试时长 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-6"},"6215":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-78","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#75-master-节点ttl-检查器","content":"| 参数                   | 类型       | 默认值  | 说明   |\n| -------------------- | -------- | ---- | ---- |\n| `ttl_retry_interval` | duration | `1s` | 重试间隔 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-6"},"6216":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-79","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#八数据淘汰机制配额与-lru","content":"除了按时间过期，Curvine 还支持基于存储配额的自动淘汰，防止集群存储空间被写满，保障系统稳定运行。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6217":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-80","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#81-工作原理","content":"开启配额淘汰后，当集群存储用量达到设定的高水位线时，系统会自动按照 LRU（最近最少使用）规则，清理长时间没有访问过的数据，直到存储空间回落至安全范围。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6218":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-81","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#83-与-ttl-的关联","content":"如果设置 `ttl_action = \"none\"`，关闭了时间过期策略，那么数据也不会被配额 LRU 机制淘汰删除，适合需要长期保留的重要数据。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6219":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-82","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#91-自动缓存","content":"当某挂载配置了非零 TTL（例如 `cv mount s3://bucket/prefix /path --ttl-ms 7d`）时，即启用该挂载的自动缓存。在该挂载下首次读取某个 UFS 文件（缓存未命中）时，Curvine 会提交一个异步加载任务，将数据拉取到 Curvine；本次读取由 UFS 直接返回，任务在后台执行。该任务与手工 `cv load` 使用相同的 Transfer 路由规则。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6220":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-83","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#91-自动缓存","content":"在日志中可看到类似输出：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6221":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-84","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#91-自动缓存","content":"客户端启用 Transfer 后，自动缓存会创建 Transfer Job。可使用 Job ID 查询状态：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6222":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-85","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#91-自动缓存","content":"`load-status` 仍是兼容命令。未启用 Transfer 的客户端仍查询旧 Master Job 路径。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6223":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-86","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#92-主动缓存","content":"先挂载 UFS，再通过它在 Curvine 中的路径主动加载：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6224":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-87","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#92-主动缓存","content":"自动缓存与主动缓存可同时使用；主动缓存可缩短该文件首次读取的等待时间。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6225":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-88","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#92-主动缓存","content":"客户端启用 Transfer 后，同一个 `cv load` 会自动提交 Transfer Job。服务部署和客户端\n路由见 Transfer 服务。可使用\n`cv transfer list` 和 `cv transfer status <job_id>` 执行任务级运维。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6226":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-89","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#92-主动缓存","content":"加载数据前，须先将 UFS 挂载到 Curvine（`cv mount`）。\n自动缓存与主动缓存均使用固定缓存路径，与 UFS 目录结构一致。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6227":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-90","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#十快速小结","content":"| 核心维度 | Curvine 核心要点                    |\n| ---- | ------------------------------- |\n| 产品定位 | 分布式文件缓存，支持 POSIX 挂载，使用体验等同于本地磁盘 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-7"},"6228":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-91","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#十快速小结","content":"| 核心维度 | Curvine 核心要点                               |\n| ---- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| 核心优势 | 统一命名空间、分层智能存储、TTL + LRU 双重空间管控、完整 POSIX 语义 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-7"},"6229":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-92","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#十快速小结","content":"| 核心维度 | Curvine 核心要点             |\n| ---- | ------------------------ |\n| 写入能力 | 支持随机写、多客户端并发写同一文件，适配复杂业务 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-7"},"6230":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-93","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#十快速小结","content":"| 核心维度 | Curvine 核心要点                   |\n| ---- | ------------------------------ |\n| 高级特性 | 支持扩展属性、软硬链接、带超时的文件锁、稀疏文件、空间预分配 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-7"},"6231":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-94","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#十快速小结","content":"| 核心维度 | Curvine 核心要点               |\n| ---- | -------------------------- |\n| 存储管理 | 多介质分层存储，客户端可指定优先级，空间不足自动降级 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-7"},"6232":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache-95","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/cache#十快速小结","content":"| 核心维度 | Curvine 核心要点                                 |\n| ---- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| 空间管控 | 基于 `mtime` 的 TTL 过期 + 可选配额 LRU 自动淘汰，灵活管控存储容量 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-7"},"6233":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","type":"page","content":"FUSE","breadcrumbs":["Documents","用户手册","核心特征"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse","locale":"zh-cn"},"6234":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Key-Features/fuse-0","page_id":"/