/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#原生-clicv","content":"| 全局参数                     | 说明                                            |\n| ------------------------ | --------------------------------------------- |\n| `--master-addrs <ADDRS>` | 直接覆盖客户端配置里的 Master 地址列表，例如 `m1:8995,m2:8995`。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"6426":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-35","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#原生-clicv","content":"生产环境通常直接使用 `cv`，因为集群配置已安装，或已通过 `CURVINE_CONF_FILE` 选择。仅在迁移或诊断时使用 `--conf` 指向非默认配置。`cv mount --config key=value` 仍表示 UFS 配置项。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6427":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-36","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#原生-clicv","content":"**约定：**","locale":"zh-cn"},"6428":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-37","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#原生-clicv","content":"生产环境将发行包的 `bin/` 加入 `PATH` 后，直接使用 `cv`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6429":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-38","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#原生-clicv","content":"通过 `cargo run -p curvine-cli -- ...` 运行时，帮助中的程序名会显示为 `curvine-cli`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6430":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-39","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#原生-clicv","content":"本文中的 `<PATH>`、`<JOB_ID>` 等为位置参数；`[OPTION]` 表示可选项。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6431":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-40","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#1-report查看集群状态","content":"**用法