/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes-5","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes#发布说明模板","content":"复制下面的模板，填入版本号和日期，随发布公告一起发布。**兼容性**表必须与版本管理与兼容性中该版本的兼容矩阵一致。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6690":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes-6","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes#已知不兼容版本","content":"当某些版本存在关键缺陷或协议级不兼容，导致在混合版本集群中不安全时，会被加入本清单。master `compatibility` 配置中的 `blocked_versions` 是这些条目的运维强制执行手段：被列为 blocked 的版本**无论模式如何都总是被拒绝**（紧急兜底）。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6691":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes-7","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes#已知不兼容版本","content":"| 版本    | 组件     | 原因                       | 引入版本  | 解决方案                |\n| ----- | ------ | ------------------------ | ----- | ------------------- |\n| 0.2.5 | worker | batch-write 路径存在严重数据损坏缺陷 | 0.2.5 | 升级到 0.2.6+ 或 0.3.0+ |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"6692":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes-8","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes#版本特定不兼容","content":"**0.3.x 旧版 worker / client 对接 0.4.x master。** 运行 0.3.x（或更早）的 worker 和 client 不上报结构化 `component_info`。master 将其识别为旧版 peer：`diagnose` 模式（默认）下允许并告警，仅在 `enforce` 模式下拒绝。不会发生数据丢失或协议错误，master 只是无法校验它们的协议版本、发布版本或能力。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6693":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes-9","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes#版本特定不兼容","content":"**预发布 vs 发布版本边界。** 预发布版本排在正式版本之前（`0.4.0-alpha < 0.4.0`）。如果配置了 `min_worker_version = \"0.4.0\"`，预发布 worker 会因低于边界而被拒绝。如需允许预发布版本，请相应调低最低版本。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6694":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes-10","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes#上报新的不兼容","content":"打开 GitHub issue 并打上 **compatibility** 标签。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6695":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes-11","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes#上报新的不兼容","content":"附带：master 版本、worker/client 版本、各组件的协议版本、完整的兼容性错误或告警，以及复现步骤。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6696":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes-12","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/release-notes#上报新的不兼容","content":"Curvine 团队评估后，要么将版本加入 `blocked_versions`，要么在本页记录该不兼容。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6697":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management","type":"page","content":"版本管理与兼容性","breadcrumbs":["Documents","用户手册","运维管理"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management","locale":"zh-cn"},"6698":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management-0","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management#版本格式","content":"版本格式","locale":"zh-cn"},"6699":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management-1","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management#协议版本","content":"协议版本","locale":"zh-cn"},"6700":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management-2","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-management","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/version-managemen