art`（没有 `status`）；查看进程请用 `ps`，或直接请求 `http://<host>:9000`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6784":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/webui-33","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/webui#启动控制台","content":"相关配置：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6785":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/webui-34","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/webui#启动控制台","content":"监控页面背后的指标采集器与 Prometheus 集成由 `[web.observability]` 控制，详见配置参考。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6786":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/webui-35","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/webui#导航结构","content":"侧边栏的分组与控制台完全一致，面包屑也读取同一份定义。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6787":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/webui-36","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/webui#导航结构","content":"| 分组       | 页面  | 路径          | 内容         |\n| -------- | --- | ----------- | ---------- |\n| Overview | 总览  | `/overview` | 集群健康、容量与活动 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"6788":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/webui-37","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/webui#导航结构","content":"| 分组         | 页面   | 路径        | 内容            |\n| ---------- | ---- | --------- | ------------- |\n| Filesystem | 文件浏览 | `/browse` | 浏览路径、查看状态与块分布 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"6789":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/webui-38","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/webui#导航结构","content":"| 分组         | 页面  | 路径        | 内容          |\n| ---------- | --- | --------- | ----------- |\n| Filesystem | 挂载  | `/mounts` | UFS 映射与校验状态 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"