 Transfers 页面；Jobs 保留旧版 Master 侧视图和 `fs_mode` 自动导出诊断。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6872":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/webui-121","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/webui#observability-与-operations","content":"`/observability` 用内置采集器渲染图表；当 `[web.observability].mode` 为 `prometheus` 或 `auto` 时改为查询 Prometheus。`/operations` 是在这之上的健康视图：当前告警、激活的 Provider，以及抓取目标中有多大比例真的在上报。关闭 FUSE 抓取（`[web.observability.fuse].enabled = false`）时，覆盖面板会如实把 FUSE 目标标为缺失。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6873":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/webui-122","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/webui#observability-与-operations","content":"通过Web管理界面，Curvine为用户提供了完整的集群管理和监控能力，大大简化了分布式缓存系统的运维工作，提高了管理效率和系统可观测性。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6874":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices","type":"page","content":"Best Practices","breadcrumbs":["Documents","用户手册"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices","locale":"zh-cn"},"6875":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices-0","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices#1-deployment-best-practices","content":"1. Deployment Best Practices","locale":"zh-cn"},"6876":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices-1","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices#11-cluster-sizing-guidelines","content":"1.1 Cluster Sizing Guidelines","locale":"zh-cn"},"6877":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices-2","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices#12-high-availability","content":"1.2 High Availability","locale":"zh-cn"},"6878":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/best-practices-3","page_id":"