urvine 集群由 Master 与 Worker 组成。FUSE 与 CLI、SDK 一样，只是多种访问方式之一，仅在应用需要本地挂载点时才有必要启用。"],[5490,"**FUSE 挂载**：通过 libfuse/3 的 POSIX 兼容挂载 (curvine-fuse)"],[5678,"**FUSE 是可选接入方式。** 须先启动 Curvine 集群（Master + Worker），FUSE 仅在应用需要 POSIX 挂载点时使用。各组件角色见 部署架构。"],[4441,"**FUSE（可选）：** 仅当需要 POSIX 文件系统挂载（如兼容旧工具、脚本）时再启动 `curvine-fuse`。FUSE 不是核心服务，集群的启动与运行不依赖它。"],[1639,"**FUSE**: libfuse2 or libfuse3 development packages"],[1835,"**FUSE**: libfuse2 or libfuse3 development packages"],[5168,"​**FUSE**: libfuse2 or libfuse3 development packages"],[5371,"**FUSE**：libfuse2 或 libfuse3 开发包"],[5278,"**FUSE接口**：提供POSIX文件系统接口，将分布式缓存挂载为本地文件系统"],[1634,"**GCC**: version 10 or later (GCC Installation)"],[5163,"​**GCC**: version 10 or later (GCC Installation)"],[1830,"**GCC**: version 10 or later (Installation Guide)"],[5366,"**GCC**：10 或更高版本（安装指南）"],[4427,"**GitHub 上统一用英文。** Issue、PR、Review 评论以及 skill 本身都用英文书写，方便社区里的每个人跟进。"],[283,"**Google Cloud Storage**: Google cloud storage, supports `gcs://` and `gs://` protocols"],[3812,"**Google Cloud Storage**：Google 云存储，支持 `gcs://` 和 `gs://` 协议"],[3287,"**Grid View Button**: Provides grid view toggle option for different browsing needs"],[6821,"**Grid View按钮**：提供网格视图切换选项，方便不同的浏览需求"],[302,"**Hadoop Environment** (version should match target HDFS cluster version):"],[3831,"**Hadoop 环境**（版本需与目标 HDFS 集群版本一致）："],[1982,"**HDD**: Capacity tier (< 10 ms)"],[5518,"**HDD**：容量层（< 10 ms）"],[1955,"**HDFS & SDK**: Java / Python / libsdk interfaces"],[5491,"**HDFS & SDK**：Java / Python / libsdk 接口"],[2020,"**HDFS ecosystem compatibility**: Offers Hadoop FileSystem integration and SDK access paths"],[1988,"**HDFS**"],[5524,"**HDFS**"],[284,"**HDFS**: Hadoop Distributed File System, supports `hdfs://` protocol (requires special environment setup)"],[3813,"**HDFS**：Hadoop 分布式文件系统，支持 `hdfs://` 协议（需要特殊环境配置）"],[241,"**High and cumbersome O&M cost**: introducing an external database adds dependent components to the cluster. This database needs to be deployed, monitored, and maintained separately, and fault recovery becomes more complex. At the same time, as the amount of metadata grows, the cost of an externally hosted database increases significantly, which does not meet the goal of controllable cost."],[275,"**High Performance**: Optimized data access paths and caching mechanisms"],[2021,"**High performance**: Uses asynchronous I/O and zero-copy-oriented data paths for low-latency, high-throughput workloads"],[3414,"**High-concurrency small files (> 1000 concurrent):**"],[6948,"**High-concurrency small files (> 1000 concurrent):**"],[1998,"**High-Performance RPC Framework**: Curvine implements a custom RPC communication framework supporting efficient data transmission with asynchronous I/O and zero-copy implementation within the framework"],[384,"**Hugepage backing**: Allocated via `curvine_spdk_dma_malloc` which returns physically contiguous, pinned memory. This satisfies the NVMe controller's DMA requirements and avoids TLB misses for large I/Os."],[3913,"**Hugepage 支持**：通过 `curvine_spdk_dma_malloc` 分配，返回物理连续且固定的内存，满足 NVMe controller 的 DMA 要求，并减少大 I/O 中的 TLB miss。"],[414,"**I/O submission and polling**: Experiment with batch submission and multi-poller approaches to scale throughput."],[3943,"**I/O 提交与轮询**：尝试批量提交和多 poller 方案，以扩展吞吐能力。"],[246,"**Idempotent retry guarantee**: synchronization operations adopt an idempotent design. Repeated execution of the same modification operation will not change the result, avoiding exceptions such as duplicate file creation or duplicate deletion and ensuring the reliability of the synchronization process."],[351,"**Idle**: The poller blocks on `eventfd` to avoid burning CPU. Handler threads signal the `eventfd` when enqueuing a new request, waking the poller into Active."],[3880,"**Idle**：poller 阻塞在 `eventfd` 上，避免空转消耗 CPU。handler 线程在入队新请求时会通知 `eventfd`，将 poller 唤醒到 Active 状态。"],[877,"**If you are reviewing**, run:"],[879,"**If you are the author responding to feedback**, run:"],[224,"**In-memory directory tree**: focuses on the ultimate speed of high-frequency operations. It only stores the most core directory structure information, such as folder names, parent folder IDs, and child node lists, and does not store detailed file attributes such as size and modification time. This design keeps memory usage extremely low and allows high-frequency operations such as directory listing and path lookup to be completed directly in memory with very fast response."],[1977,"**IO Handlers**: Read / Write pipeline with zero-copy"],[5513,"**IO Handlers**：读/写管道，具有零拷贝"],[358,"**IoCompletion**: Bridges handler and poller threads. The handler blocks on `wait(timeout)`; the poller's C callback wakes it via `complete(status)`."],[3887,"**IoCompletion**：连接 handler 和 poller 线程。handler 在 `wait(timeout)` 上阻塞；poller 的 C 回调通过 `complete(status)` 唤醒它。"],[356,"**IoOp**: The operation enum. `Read` and `Write` carry namespace, qpair, DMA buffer, offset, and length. `Flush` targets a namespace; `UnregisterQpair` notifies cleanup."],[3885,"**IoOp**：操作枚举。`Read` 和 `Write` 携带 namespace、qpair、DMA buffer、offset 和 length；`Flush` 作用于 namespace；`UnregisterQpair` 用于通知清理。"],[357,"**IoRequest**: The envelope wrapping an `IoOp`, `Arc<IoCompletion>`, and the per-bdev inflight counter. Sent through the crossbeam channel."],[3886,"**IoRequest**：封装 `IoOp`、`Arc<IoCompletion>` 以及每个 bdev 的 inflight 计数器，通过 crossbeam channel 发送。"],[3296,"**IP Address**: Network address of the worker node"],[6830,"**IP地址**：工作节点的网络地址"],[1685,"**Issue 1: Insufficient permissions**"],[1661,"**Issue 1: protoc command not found**"],[1673,"**Issue 2: macFUSE not properly installed**"],[1656,"**Issue 2: Maven command not found**"],[1662,"**Issue 2: Maven command not found**"],[1686,"**Issue 2: Node.js version too low**"],[1687,"**Issue 3: Java environment issues**"],[1674,"**Issue 3: Java version issues**"],[1657,"**Issue 3: Rust-related commands not found**"],[1663,"**Issue 3: Rust-related commands not found**"],[1688,"**Issue 4: FUSE module not loaded**"],[1658,"**Issue 4: GCC version too low (< 10.0)**"],[1664,"**Issue 4: GCC version too low (< 10.0)**"],[1675,"**Issue 4: GCC version**"],[1689,"**Issue 5: GCC version too low (< 10.0)**"],[1676,"**Issue 5: Python version issues**"],[1659,"**Issue 5: Python version too low (< 3.7)**"],[1660,"**Issue 6: pip installation failed or version too old**"],[1677,"**Issue 6: pip related issues**"],[1690,"**Issue 6: Python version too low (< 3.7)**"],[1691,"**Issue 7: pip related issues**"],[301,"**Java Environment** (JDK 8 or above):"],[3830,"**Java 环境**（JDK 8 及以上版本）："],[1640,"**JDK**: version 1.8 or later (OpenJDK or Oracle JDK)"],[1836,"**JDK**: version 1.8 or later (OpenJDK or Oracle JDK)"],[5169,"​**JDK**: version 1.8 or later (OpenJDK or Oracle JDK)"],[5372,"**JDK**：1.8 或更高版本（OpenJDK 或 Oracle JDK）"],[174,"**Journal**: Every metadata change is persisted as a **journal entry** (e.g. `Mkdir`, `CreateFile`, `AddBlock`, `CompleteFile`, `Rename`, `Delete`, `Mount`, `UnMount`). The leader appends entries to the Raft log; once committed, they are applied to the in-memory metadata tree (`FsDir`)."],[1968,"**JournalSystem**: Edit log and snapshot for recovery"],[5504,"**JournalSystem**：编辑日志和快照以进行恢复"],[899,"**Keep GitHub English.** Issues, PRs, review comments, and skills themselves are written in English so everyone in the community can follow along."],[3499,"**Kernel parameter optimization**: Adjust network buffers, resource limits, and other parameters"],[2027,"**Large Language Model Inference**: Optimizes data access for LLM inference scenarios, reducing inference latency and improving model service response speed and throughput"],[3297,"**Last Heartbeat Time**: Shows the last communication time between the node and Master"],[242,"**Limited optimization space**: external databases are general-purpose designs and cannot be customized for characteristics such as high-frequency directory operations and batch reads/writes of metadata. A self-developed architecture can deeply optimize core processes such as path resolution and on-demand loading, making it better suited to business requirements."],[1638,"**LLVM**: version 12 or later (Installation Guide)"],[1834,"**LLVM**: version 12 or later (Installation Guide)"],[5167,"​**LLVM**: version 12 or later (Installation Guide)"],[5370,"**LLVM**：12 或更高版本（安装指南）"],[1989,"**Local FS**"],[5525,"**Local FS**"],[229,"**Log replay ensures consistency**: the Leader node in the cluster is responsible for initiating modification operations and recording logs. Follower nodes synchronize the Leader's logs in real time and execute the same modification operations one by one in log order, ensuring that the metadata state of all nodes is completely consistent and avoiding data divergence."],[228,"**Log synchronization first**: any metadata modification operation, such as creation, deletion, rename, or attribute modification, is first packaged as an operation log and stored in a dedicated log database, then synchronized to more than half of the machines in the cluster. Only after most machines successfully receive and store this log is the modification operation officially effective, ensuring that data will not be lost due to a single machine failure."],[2334,"**Master address**: Set `client.master_addrs` in the cluster config (e.g. `curvine-cluster.toml`) or pass the equivalent in each SDK (Java: `fs.cv.master_addrs`, Spark: `spark.hadoop.fs.cv.master_addrs`). Format: `host1:8995,host2:8995`."],[3264,"**Master Node Address**: Shows the access address and port of the Master node"],[1731,"**Master nodes** (can be multiple for high availability): Responsible for metadata management, worker node coordination, and load balancing"],[5871,"**Master 地址**：在集群配置（如 `curvine-cluster.toml`）中设置 `client.master_addrs`，或在各 SDK 中传入等价配置（如 Java 的 `fs.cv.master_addrs`）。格式：`host1:8995,host2:8995`。"],[5267,"**Master 节点**（可多节点部署以实现高可用）：负责元数据管理、Worker 协调与负载均衡"],[3317,"**master_hostname**: Hostname of the Master node"],[6851,"**master_hostname**：Master节点的主机名"],[3323,"**master_io_close_idle**: Idle connection closure configuration for the Master node"],[6857,"**master_io_close_idle**：Master节点空闲连接关闭配置"],[3320,"**master_io_threads**: Number of IO threads for the Master node"],[6854,"**master_io_threads**：Master节点IO线程数"],[3322,"**master_io_timeout**: IO timeout for the Master node"],[6856,"**master_io_timeout**：Master节点IO超时时间"],[3326,"**master_meta_compression_type**: Metadata compression type"],[6860,"**master_meta_compression_type**：元数据压缩类型"],[3324,"**master_meta_dir**: Metadata storage directory for the Master node"],[6858,"**master_meta_dir**：Master节点元数据存储目录"],[3325,"**master_meta_disable_wal**: Metadata WAL logging switch"],[6859,"**master_meta_disable_wal**：元数据WAL日志开关"],[3318,"**master_rpc_port**: RPC service port of the Master node"],[6852,"**master_rpc_port**：Master节点RPC服务端口"],[3319,"**master_web_port**: Web service port of the Master node"],[6853,"**master_web_port**：Master节点Web服务端口"],[3321,"**master_worker_threads**: Number of worker threads for the Master node"],[6855,"**master_worker_threads**：Master节点工作线程数"],[1963,"**Master**: The core control node; responsible for metadata (directory tree, file inodes, block locations), Worker registration, block allocation, and UFS mount table. Master can run as multiple nodes forming a Raft group for high availability; only the Raft leader serves metadata writes."],[5499,"**Master**：核心控制节点；负责元数据（目录树、文件 inode、块位置）、Worker 注册、块分配和 UFS 挂载表。Master 可以作为多个节点运行，形成 Raft 组以实现高可用性；只有 Raft Leader 处理元数据写入。"],[1966,"**MasterFilesystem**: File system operations (mkdir, create, rename, delete, list)"],[5502,"**MasterFilesystem**：文件系统操作（mkdir、create、rename、delete、list）"],[1965,"**MasterServer**: RPC handling and routing"],[5501,"**MasterServer**：RPC 处理和路由"],[1637,"**Maven**: version 3.8 or later (Install Guide)"],[1833,"**Maven**: version 3.8 or later (Install Guide)"],[5166,"​**Maven**: version 3.8 or later (Install Guide)"],[5369,"**Maven**：3.8 或更高版本（安装指南）"],[1980,"**MEM**: In-memory tier (< 100 ns)"],[5516,"**MEM**：内存层（< 100 ns）"],[244,"**Metadata mirror synchronization**: all metadata modifications in Curvine, such as creation, deletion, and attribute modification, are asynchronously synchronized to UFS in the background after being completed locally. This ensures that the directory structure and file attributes of Curvine and UFS are completely consistent, implementing a unified namespace."],[190,"**Metadata**: The client asks the Master for file metadata and **block locations** (which Worker(s) hold which block IDs, offsets, lengths). The Master returns `FileBlocks` (file status + list of block locations)."],[1994,"**Metrics**: Prometheus-based monitoring (master/worker/client, job, cache)"],[5530,"**Metrics**：基于 Prometheus 的监控（master/worker/client、job、cache）"],[1962,"**Mount & Meta Cache**: Caches mount info and inode metadata"],[5498,"**Mount & Meta Cache**：缓存挂载信息和 inode 元数据"],[2031,"**Multi-cloud Data Caching**: Improves data access efficiency across clouds and regions"],[2016,"**Multi-cloud storage support**: Works with S3-compatible systems, HDFS, OSS, MinIO, and other UFS backends through a unified access layer"],[2005,"**Multi-Replica Mechanism**: Multi-replica mechanism ensures data redundancy backup, improving system reliability and fault tolerance"],[274,"**Multi-Storage Support**: Support for object storage, filesystems, databases, and more"],[2018,"**Multi-tier cache**: Supports memory, SSD, and HDD cache strategies"],[2882,"**Native Rust CLI `cv`**: the recommended entry point, with the full command tree from `curvine-cli`."],[3280,"**Navigate Button**: Provides a \"Navigate\" button for path jumping"],[3408,"**Never rename large directories** on S3/OSS backends — it triggers full data copy."],[6942,"**Never rename large directories** on S3/OSS backends — it triggers full data copy."],[3298,"**Node Capacity Information**:"],[3295,"**Node ID**: Unique identifier for the worker node"],[3305,"**Node Recovery Status**: Tracks the recovery status of offline nodes"],[3269,"**Node Status Indicators**: Visual display of node health status through color coding"],[303,"**Note**: Ensure all Worker nodes have the correct Java and Hadoop environment variables configured, otherwise HDFS mount and load operations will fail."],[1641,"**npm**: version 9 or later (Node.js Installation)"],[1837,"**npm**: version 9 or later (Node.js Installation)"],[5373,"**npm**：9 或更高版本（Node.js 安装）"],[5170,"**npm**：版本 9 及以上（Node.js 安装）"],[3303,"**Offline Node List**: Displays currently offline or unresponsive worker nodes"],[3268,"**Offline Worker Count**: Shows currently offline or failed Worker nodes"],[251,"**One fallback**: through fs-mode cooperation with UFS, metadata and file data have dual backups, ensuring data safety while supporting fast fault recovery."],[250,"**One trade-off**: the Leader-first write strategy uses an extremely short consistency window in exchange for low latency and high throughput in high-concurrency scenarios, adapting to the core scenario of massive small-file reads and writes."],[346,"**Opaque ZST pointers**: SPDK types like `spdk_nvme_ctrlr` are declared as zero-sized enums in Rust — they exist only for compile-time type safety. At runtime they are raw pointers passed straight to C."],[1990,"**OpenDAL (Azure, GCS, etc.)**"],[5526,"**OpenDAL (Azure, GCS, etc.)**"],[1530,"**Option A — Compile in container, output to local `build/dist`:**"],[1532,"**Option B — Persistent development container:**"],[1992,"**orpc**: High-performance RPC framework (Tokio-based, zero-copy)"],[5528,"**orpc**：高性能 RPC 框架（基于 Tokio，零拷贝）"],[353,"**Orphaned (HashMap)**: When `curvine_spdk_qpair_poll` returns an error, the qpair is moved from Active into an `orphaned` HashMap. The poller force-completes all pending I/Os on the failed qpair via `force_complete_qpair`, waking blocked handler threads with an error status. The orphaned entry persists to catch late SPDK callbacks."],[3882,"**Orphaned（HashMap）**：当 `curvine_spdk_qpair_poll` 返回错误时，对应 qpair 会从 Active 转入 `orphaned` HashMap。poller 会通过 `force_complete_qpair` 强制完成该 qpair 上所有挂起 I/O，并用错误状态唤醒阻塞的 handler 线程。orphaned 记录会保留，用来接住后续迟到的 SPDK 回调。"],[1987,"**OSS**"],[5523,"**OSS**"],[1523,"**Partial builds:** `make build ARGS='-p core'` (server+client+cli), `make build ARGS='-p core -p fuse'`, `make build ARGS='-p web'`, `make build ARGS='-d'` (debug). Use `make build-hdfs` for HDFS support (native + WebHDFS); `make build ARGS='--skip-java-sdk'` to skip Java SDK."],[3279,"**Path Navigation Bar**: Displays the current file system path with support for quick navigation"],[3329,"**Performance Tuning Reference**: Evaluate performance optimization opportunities based on current configuration"],[380,"**poller_is_sleeping**: Shared `AtomicBool` set true by the poller when idle; bdevs check it to skip the eventfd write syscall"],[3909,"**poller_is_sleeping**：由 poller 在 idle 时置为 true 的共享 `AtomicBool`；bdev 会检查它，从而跳过不必要的 eventfd write 系统调用"],[378,"**poller_tx**: Crossbeam sender to submit `IoRequest`s to the poller thread"],[3907,"**poller_tx**：用于向 poller 线程提交 `IoRequest` 的 crossbeam sender"],[2884,"**POSIX / FUSE**: after mounting with FUSE, use standard Linux commands directly on the mount point."],[6419,"**POSIX / FUSE**：通过 FUSE 挂载后，直接在挂载点使用标准 Linux 命令。"],[5555,"**POSIX 兼容访问**：通过 FUSE 将缓存数据以本地文件系统方式暴露给现有应用"],[2019,"**POSIX-compatible access**: Provides a FUSE layer so existing applications can access cached data as a local file system"],[385,"**Pre-allocated and reused**: Each `SpdkBdev` allocates two buffers (read + write) at open time via `curvine_spdk_dma_malloc` and reuses them for every I/O. This avoids a malloc/free cycle per I/O — the buffer is zero-cost after the first allocation."],[3159,"**Pre-release vs release bounds.** Pre-release versions sort before the\ncorresponding release version (`0.4.0-alpha < 0.4.0`). If\n`min_worker_version = \"0.4.0\"` is configured, a pre-release worker is rejected\nbecause it sorts below the bound. To allow pre-releases, lower the minimum\nbound accordingly."],[247,"**Progress tracking and fast recovery**: the system separately records the latest Curvine local modification progress and UFS synchronization progress. If UFS falls too far behind due to failure or network disconnection, after recovery it does not need to resynchronize all data. It only needs to continue synchronization from the last interrupted progress, greatly improving recovery efficiency."],[240,"**Prone to performance bottlenecks**: metadata operations are mostly high-frequency small requests. When massive clients connect to an external database at the same time, it is easy to exhaust database connections, causing QPS to hit a ceiling and making it unable to support high-concurrency scenarios."],[1832,"**Protobuf**: version 3.x"],[1636,"**Protobuf**: version 3.x+ (Install Guide)"],[5165,"​**Protobuf**: version 3.x+ (Install Guide)"],[5368,"**Protobuf**：3.x 版本"],[1997,"**Pure Rust Implementation**: Curvine is implemented entirely in Rust, avoiding performance bottlenecks and resource consumption of traditional languages while ensuring code safety and stability"],[1642,"**Python**: version 3.7 or later"],[5171,"**Python**: version 3.7 or later"],[1838,"**Python**: version 3.7 or later (Installation Guide)"],[5374,"**Python**：3.7 或更高版本（安装指南）"],[377,"**qpair**: The NVMe queue pair for issuing commands"],[3906,"**qpair**：用于发起命令的 NVMe queue pair"],[1970,"**Quota / Job / Replication**: Quota control, TTL, eviction, replication scheduling"],[5506,"**Quota / Job / Replication**：配额控制、TTL、驱逐、复制调度"],[1972,"**Raft Consensus**: Leader election and log replication"],[5508,"**Raft Consensus**：Leader 选举和日志复制"],[2003,"**Raft Protocol**: Uses Raft protocol to implement distributed consistency, ensuring data consistency and reliability"],[5558,"**Raft 元数据高可用**：通过 Raft 保证 Master 元数据一致性"],[2022,"**Raft-based metadata HA**: Uses Raft to keep metadata consistent across Master nodes"],[5539,"**Raft协议**：使用用 Raft 协议实现分布式一致性，保证数据的一致性和可靠性。"],[3415,"**Random read:**"],[6949,"**Random read:**"],[186,"**Read path**: The Worker’s `ReadHandler` receives block-read RPCs, opens the block file, and returns data (with optional read-ahead and sendfile-style optimizations)."],[373,"**Release**: Push the qpair back into the pool. If the pool exceeds the limit (16 per controller by default), free the excess via `curvine_spdk_free_io_qpair` to bound controller-side memory."],[3902,"**Release**：将 qpair 放回池中。如果池超过上限（默认每个 controller 16 个），则通过 `curvine_spdk_free_io_qpair` 释放多余 qpair，以限制 controller 侧内存占用。"],[277,"**Reliability**: Built-in retry mechanisms and error handling"],[177,"**Replay**: `JournalLoader` applies each committed `JournalEntry` to the local `FsDir` (e.g. `mkdir`, `create_file`, `add_block`, `complete_file`, `rename`, `delete`, `mount`, `unmount`). This keeps standby state identical to the leader."],[1978,"**Replication / Tasks**: Background replication and task scheduling"],[5514,"**Replication / Tasks**：后台复制和任务调度"],[387,"**Reuse through chunking**: Large I/Os are split into `dma_buf_size` chunks and processed serially through the same fixed buffer, avoiding the need for dynamically-sized DMA memory."],[1971,"**RocksDB Metadata Store**: Persistent metadata storage"],[5507,"**RocksDB Metadata Store**：持久元数据存储"],[225,"**RocksDB**: focuses on reliable storage of massive data and carries the complete detailed information of all files and directories, including file size, permissions, modification time, and the location of data blocks on disk. By classifying and managing different types of metadata through column families, data organization becomes clearer. At the same time, RocksDB's high-concurrency read/write characteristics ensure the read/write efficiency of massive metadata."],[3754,"**RocksDB**：聚焦海量数据的可靠存储，承载所有文件/目录的完整详细信息，包括文件大小、权限、修改时间、数据块在磁盘中的位置等。通过列族分类管理不同类型的元数据，让数据组织更清晰，同时利用自身高并发读写特性，确保海量元数据的读写效率。"],[180,"**Role detection**: `MasterMonitor` exposes whether the current node is active: `is_active()` is true only when the Raft role is **Leader**. The client or upper layer should route metadata write requests to the current leader (e.g. by resolving the leader from the cluster config or a router)."],[176,"**Role**: Raft followers do **not** serve metadata write RPC. They receive committed log entries from the leader and **replay** them to keep a copy of the metadata."],[173,"**Role**: The Raft leader is the only node that accepts metadata-mutating RPC (create file, add block, rename, delete, mount/umount, etc.)."],[1635,"**Rust**: version 1.98 (pinned by `rust-toolchain.toml`; `build/check-env.sh` accepts 1.86 or later) (Installation Guide)"],[1831,"**Rust**: version 1.98 (pinned by `rust-toolchain.toml`; `build/check-env.sh` accepts 1.86 or later) (Installation Guide)"],[5164,"**Rust**：1.98（由 `rust-toolchain.toml` 固定；`build/check-env.sh` 接受 1.86 及以上） (Installation Guide)"],[5367,"**Rust**：1.98（由 `rust-toolchain.toml` 固定；`build/check-env.sh` 接受 1.86 及以上）（安装指南）"],[1986,"**S3 / MinIO**"],[5522,"**S3 / MinIO**"],[252,"**Selection advantage**: by giving up external databases and adopting a local architecture, Curvine reduces latency and O&M costs while retaining room for customized optimization, perfectly matching the core requirements of a distributed file system."],[3413,"**Sequential read (large files > 100GB):**"],[6947,"**Sequential read (large files > 100GB):**"],[2030,"**Shuffle Data Storage**: Stores intermediate results (shuffle) during big data computation, achieving complete separation of compute and storage"],[4429,"**Skill 和代码一起维护。** 想改进某个 skill，请遵循 `cv-add-skills`，并同步更新 `AGENTS.md` 中的注册表。"],[901,"**Skills live with the code.** If you want to improve one, follow `cv-add-skills` and keep the registry in `AGENTS.md` up to date."],[234,"**Small cost**: an extremely short consistency window. If the Leader node fails just after completing the local modification but before synchronizing the log, these unsynchronized modifications may not be synchronized to other nodes. However, this window is extremely short, usually only a few milliseconds, and the probability of occurrence in actual production is extremely low. It is an acceptable trade-off between performance and consistency."],[2006,"**Snapshot Mechanism**: Lightweight snapshot mechanism for periodic data backup, improving system recovery speed and stability"],[178,"**Snapshot**: The system supports Raft snapshots; when a snapshot exists, the metadata can be restored from it instead of replaying from the beginning."],[230,"**Snapshots accelerate recovery**: if a machine falls too far behind the Leader due to failure or network disconnection, it does not need to replay all historical logs one by one. The Leader directly sends a complete snapshot of the current data. After loading the snapshot, the machine can quickly catch up with the cluster progress, greatly shortening fault recovery time and improving system availability."],[1983,"**SPDK**: User-space NVMe acceleration"],[5519,"**SPDK**：用户空间 NVMe 加速"],[1981,"**SSD**: NVMe / SATA (< 100 µs)"],[5517,"**SSD**：NVMe / SATA（< 100 µs）"],[3266,"**Startup Time**: Shows the cluster startup timestamp"],[179,"**Storage**: Metadata log and Raft state use **RocksDB** (`RocksLogStorage`). The journal is the application payload carried in Raft log entries."],[2146,"**Supported systems**: FUSE 2 and FUSE 3 are supported; behavior may vary by distribution. See Supported Linux Distributions."],[3941,"**Target 侧混合模式**：将 active/idle 状态切换应用到 SPDK NVMe-oF target，在空闲时降低 CPU 使用率。"],[412,"**Target-side hybrid mode**: Apply active/idle state transitions to the SPDK NVMe-oF target to reduce CPU usage when idle."],[281,"**Tencent Cloud COS**: Tencent Cloud object storage, supports `cos://` protocol"],[3315,"**testing**: Test mode switch status"],[6849,"**testing**：测试模式开关状态"],[3498,"**Thread count tuning**: Adjust the number of worker threads based on CPU cores and business load"],[249,"**Three-layer division of responsibilities**: the in-memory directory tree handles speed, with high-frequency operations responding instantly; RocksDB handles storage, reliably carrying massive metadata; the Raft protocol handles consistency, keeping multi-node data free of divergence. The three work together to achieve fast, stable, efficient, and complete behavior."],[198,"**Through**: Data is written only to UFS; cache is bypassed."],[3727,"**Through**：仅写 UFS，绕过缓存。"],[872,"**Title:** `<type>(<module>): <description> (#<issueNumber>)`"],[3291,"**Total Capacity Display**: Shows the total storage capacity of all worker nodes"],[3274,"**Total File Count**: Displays the total number of files in the file system"],[3270,"**Total Storage Capacity**: Displays the total storage capacity of the cluster"],[1743,"**Transfer Service (optional)**: Runs Load and Export jobs outside the Master process; see Transfer Service."],[5279,"**Transfer 服务（可选）**：在 Master 进程之外运行 Load 与 Export 任务，参见 Transfer 服务。"],[3330,"**Troubleshooting Support**: Quickly check relevant configurations when issues arise"],[1730,"**UFS Cluster**: As the underlying storage backend, connected to the Curvine cluster through mounting, such as S3, HDFS, and other clusters."],[1984,"**UFS**: Underlying storage (S3, HDFS, etc.) accessed through Curvine’s data orchestration; Curvine provides a unified file system view over mounted UFS paths and native paths."],[5520,"**UFS**：底层存储（S3、HDFS 等）通过 Curvine 的数据编排访问；Curvine 在挂载的 UFS 路径和原生路径上提供统一文件系统视图。"],[273,"**Unified Interface**: Consistent APIs across different storage backends"],[1959,"**UnifiedFileSystem**: Provides unified namespace with CurvineFS + UFS fallback"],[5495,"**UnifiedFileSystem**：提供 CurvineFS + UFS 回退的统一命名空间"],[3302,"**Usage Rate Indicator**: Visual display of node storage usage rate through progress bars"],[3043,"**Usage:** `cv admin config <set|get|reset> ...`"],[3036,"**Usage:** `cv bench [OPTIONS]` and `cv bench prefill [OPTIONS]`"],[3008,"**Usage:** `cv cancel-load [