lassName: curvine-sc`"],[2585,"`storageClassName: curvine-sc`"],[5905,"`storageClassName: curvine-sc`"],[6122,"`storageClassName: curvine-sc`"],[726,"`strace -f -e trace=network ...` for connection issues"],[4255,"`strace -f -e trace=network ...`：排查连接问题"],[790,"`tests/` for copied benchmark and regression scripts"],[4318,"`tests/`：复制后的压测与回归脚本"],[4907,"`transfer.storeUrl` 为空时使用单 Pod SQLite 默认值。Chart 会为其数据目录创建 `ReadWriteOnce` PVC，且不设置 `storageClassName`，因此 Kubernetes 自动使用默认 StorageClass；Pod 被替换后数据仍会保留。`transfer.replicas > 1` 时 MySQL 是必需的，高可用部署也建议使用 MySQL。"],[2804,"`TTL Action`: cache expiration handling policy."],[6339,"`TTL Action`：缓存过期处理策略"],[2977,"`validate_path_and_configs` currently applies extra path validation only to S3 paths; other schemes mostly rely on later provider initialization and connectivity checks."],[6512,"`validate_path_and_configs` 当前只对 S3 路径做额外格式校验；其它 scheme 主要依赖后续 provider 初始化和连通性检查。"],[2162,"`validate-config` loads the config, verifies that `fuse.state_dir` is writable\n(creating it when missing), and warns about unrecognized `[fuse]` keys — the\nkind of typo that would otherwise silently keep a default. It exits non-zero\nwhen the config cannot be parsed or the state directory is unusable. It does not\nmount, and it does not check Master reachability. The Curvine CSI driver calls it\nduring node-side mount setup."],[5697,"`validate-config` 会加载配置，校验 `fuse.state_dir` 可写（不存在则创建），并对无法识别的 `[fuse]` 键给出告警——这类拼写错误本来会被静默忽略并沿用默认值。配置无法解析或 state 目录不可用时以非零码退出。它不会挂载，也不会检查 Master 是否可达。Curvine CSI 驱动在节点侧准备挂载时就是调用它。"],[2413,"`ValidateStorageClassParams` in `pkg/csi/validator.go` enforces:"],[3214,"`verdict` takes one of: `compatible`, `missing_info`, `blocked`,\n`protocol_mismatch`, `version_too_old`, `version_unknown`."],[6748,"`verdict` 取值：`compatible`、`missing_info`、`blocked`、`protocol_mismatch`、`version_too_old`、`version_unknown`。"],[6657,"`verdict` 标签取值：`compatible`、`missing_info`、`blocked`、\n`protocol_mismatch`、`version_too_old`、`version_unknown`。建议对\n`compat_worker_verdict` / `compat_client_verdict` 中非 `compatible` 的结论设置告警，\n以发现混合版本集群；对 `compat_enforce_rejected_total` 的增长设置告警，\n及早发现升级冲突。"],[2584,"`volumeClaimTemplates` entry named `data`"],[2378,"`volumeHandle = {cluster-id}@{fs-path}@{pv-name}`"],[5915,"`volumeHandle = {cluster-id}@{fs-path}@{pv-name}`"],[1036,"`worker_policy = \"local\"` prefers a local Worker for the first replica and assigns the remaining replicas through the weighted policy. `weighted` allocates according to `worker.weight`."],[4563,"`worker_policy = \"local\"` 会为第一个副本优先选择本地 Worker，其余副本通过 weighted 策略分配；`weighted` 按 `worker.weight` 分配。"],[1266,"`worker.enable_s3_gateway` (default `false`) selects where multipart staging lives: `false` keeps upload parts on the gateway host's local filesystem, `true` uses Curvine DFS so several gateway instances can serve the same upload."],[2273,"`worker.enable_s3_gateway` (in the `[worker]` section) selects distributed multipart storage: upload parts are written under `/.s3temp` in Curvine instead of `put_temp_dir`, so any gateway instance can complete an upload. Setting it also switches the binary to the distributed credential store."],[1267,"`worker.enable_s3_gateway` is read by the gateway process, not by the Worker. You can set it in the gateway's own config file; it does not require restarting Workers."],[4794,"`worker.enable_s3_gateway` 由网关进程读取，Worker 本身不读取该字段。可以只在网关的配置文件里设置，无需重启 Worker。"],[4793,"`worker.enable_s3_gateway`（默认 `false`）决定分片上传的暂存位置：`false` 时存放在网关宿主机的本地文件系统，`true` 时使用 Curvine DFS，从而允许多个网关实例共同处理同一次上传。"],[1461,"`worker.s3Gateway.*` is live: with `enabled: true` the chart adds the\n`[s3_gateway]` block and `worker.enable_s3_gateway` to the ConfigMap, and creates\na Service on `worker.s3Gateway.listen` (default `0.0.0.0:9900`). The worker\ncontainer still only runs `/entrypoint.sh worker start`, so nothing starts the\ngateway binary for you — run `curvine-s3-gateway` as a sidecar or a separate\nDeployment until the chart ships one."],[4998,"`worker.s3Gateway.*` 是生效的：`enabled: true` 时 Chart 会把 `[s3_gateway]` 和 `worker.enable_s3_gateway` 写进 ConfigMap，并在 `worker.s3Gateway.listen`（默认 `0.0.0.0:9900`）上创建 Service。但 worker 容器仍然只运行 `/entrypoint.sh worker start`，不会帮你启动网关进程——在 Chart 提供之前，请用 sidecar 或单独的 Deployment 运行 `curvine-s3-gateway`。"],[2803,"`Write Type`: core read/write mode, `cache_mode` or `fs_mode`."],[6338,"`Write Type`：核心读写模式（`cache_mode` / `fs_mode`）"],[5892,"`副本数`：`3`"],[5893,"`容器内挂载路径`：`/usr/share/nginx/html`"],[2669,"| Action   | Meaning                                                                                                                                                  |\n| -------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `delete` | Deletes file data and metadata after expiration. This is the most common expiration cleanup strategy, calculated from the file's last modification time. |"],[2670,"| Action | Meaning                                                                                                                                                                                     |\n| ------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `free` | Releases only file data blocks after expiration while preserving directories and metadata. This is suitable for scenarios that need to keep directory structure while cleaning cached data. |"],[2668,"| Action | Meaning                                                                                               |\n| ------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `none` | Disables time-based expiration. Data is retained until manually deleted or cleaned by other policies. |"],[828,"| Area                     