ed credential nor an environment pair is available, the gateway starts with an empty store and rejects every request."],[2220,"The gateway is an optional, standalone service. It is not started by `curvine-server`, but it **is** part of the default build and release package: `build.sh` builds `curvine-s3-gateway` with the default `--package all`, and the distribution ships `bin/curvine-s3-gateway.sh` next to the other service scripts."],[2288,"The gateway is stateless apart from temporary multipart data and credentials, so it can run behind a load balancer:"],[2291,"The gateway logs through `tracing` to stdout. Adjust the level with `RUST_LOG`:"],[2244,"The gateway maps S3 paths onto the Curvine namespace without an extra prefix:"],[2251,"The gateway reuses the regular Curvine cluster configuration file. Add an `[s3_gateway]` section for gateway-specific settings; the `[client]`, `[master]`, and other sections are used to connect to the cluster:"],[1382,"The generated ConfigMap is used by Master, Worker, and Transfer. External CLI\nhosts must also use a cluster config with `[transfer] enabled = true`; the CLI\ncommands remain `cv load`, `cv export`, `cv load-status`, and\n`cv cancel-load`."],[131,"The generated mount script starts `curvine-fuse` with the target path provided by Fluid."],[856,"The GitHub CLI signed in, because some skills file issues, push branches, or post review comments. Check with `gh auth status`."],[2317,"The Hadoop path uses the URI scheme **`cv://`** (not `fs.cv://`) and\n`io.curvine.CurvineFileSystem`, so `FileSystem.get(URI.create(\"cv://default/path\"), conf)`\nreturns a Curvine client."],[396,"The handler blocks on a condition variable waiting for completion."],[394,"The handler calls `SpdkBdev::read_region(enable_send_file, len)`, which reads from the bdev's current position. The underlying `spdk_read()` splits large reads into DMA-buffer-sized chunks (1 MB by default) and processes each through the poller:"],[398,"The handler copies data